{#
  Button: the primary action control.

  Write the label in sentence case, the component sets display caps. Labels
  name the destination ("Book a consultation"), never generic ("Learn more").
  Alt glyphs are never used on buttons.

  Variants (design.md section 6, LOCKED set):
    primary    madder fill, white label. Reserved for the single CTA moment.
    secondary  outlined, fills to solid ink on hover.
    ghost      text link, underline draws in from the left.
    deep       paper outline, for use ON an ink pane (not a green button;
               Button.prompt.md in the design project is stale on this).

  Two more, PROPOSED additions to the locked set awaiting sign-off, not
  decisions already taken. design.md section 6 says "LOCKED SET, nothing
  else" and the design system's own components.css carries only the four
  above. For use ON a madder pane, where deep is wrong because its hover
  carries ink and madder wants madder:
    on-accent-primary  paper fill, paper border, madder label. The primary
                       action on madder.
    on-accent          paper outline, paper label, fills to paper with a
                       madder label. The secondary.

  There are no size variants. The design system has one button size.

  Passing `href` renders an anchor, otherwise a real <button>. `arrow` adds the
  sliding arrow, which belongs to the ghost treatment.

  Usage:
    {% raw %}{% from "components/button.njk" import button %}
    {{ button("Book a discovery call", href="/contact/") }}
    {{ button("View case study", variant="ghost", href="/work/", arrow=true) }}{% endraw %}
#}
{% macro button(label, href="", variant="primary", arrow=false, class="", type="button", ariaLabel="") %}
{%- set classes = "cs-btn cs-btn--" + variant + (" " + class if class else "") -%}
{%- if href -%}
<a class="{{ classes }}" href="{{ href }}"{% if ariaLabel %} aria-label="{{ ariaLabel }}"{% endif %}>{{ label }}{% if arrow %}<span class="cs-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>{% endif %}</a>
{%- else -%}
<button class="{{ classes }}" type="{{ type }}"{% if ariaLabel %} aria-label="{{ ariaLabel }}"{% endif %}>{{ label }}{% if arrow %}<span class="cs-link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>{% endif %}</button>
{%- endif -%}
{% endmacro %}
